---
                                                                                                                        
        ┌ Help ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐         
        │  Global (chords work from any pane)                 Mouse                                           │         
        │                                                                                                     │         
        │  d / Ctrl+d         Toggle command / pane           Mouse click     Focus pane                      │         
        │  n / Ctrl+n         Create new agent                Ctrl+click      Open hyperlink                  │         
        │  Alt+Shift+l        Toggle layout (stacked/tiled)                                                   │         
        │  Ctrl+c             Quit                            New Agent Form                                  │         
        │                                                                                                     │         
        │  Tab Navigation                                     Tab             Switch field                    │         
        │                                                     ◀/▶             Cycle mode                      │         
        │  Tab / Right / l    Next tab                        Enter           Next field / confirm            │         
        │  Shift+Tab / Left / h Prev tab                      Esc             Cancel                          │         
        │  Ctrl+PgDn          Next tab                                                                        │         
        │  Ctrl+PgUp          Prev tab                        Directory Picker                                │         
        │                                                                                                     │         
        │  Dashboard (command mode)                           j / Down        Select next                     │         
        │                                                     k / Up          Select previous                 │         
        │  j / Down           Select next card                l / Right / Enter   Enter directory             │         
        │  k / Up             Select previous card            h / Left / Bksp     Go up one level             │         
        │  1-9                Jump to card N                  Space           Confirm current directory       │         
        │  Enter              Focus selected pane             /               Filter (case-insensitive)       │         
        │  w / Ctrl+w         Close selected agent (confirms) Esc             Clear filter (twice = close)    │         
        │  Ctrl+l             Cycle sidebar split stage       q               Cancel                          │         
        │  z / Ctrl+z         Zoom focused pane                                                               │         
        │  b                  Show / hide agent badges        Session                                         │         
        │  Ctrl+e             Toggle command-entry lock                                                       │         
        │  /                  Filter agents                   Panes auto-saved continuously.                  │         
        │  Esc                Clear filter                    Restored automatically on launch.               │         
        │  r / Ctrl+r         Rename agent                                                                    │         
        │  g / Ctrl+g         Generate .dot-agent-deck.toml                                                   │         
        │  y / n              Approve / deny permission                                                       │         
        │  s / Ctrl+s         Schedules manager                                                               │         
        │  m / Ctrl+m         Host of this deck                                                               │         
        │  i                  Deck messages: Retry or Cancel                                                  │         
        │  o                  Open pull request                                                               │         
        │  u / Ctrl+u         Upgrade (update badge)                                                          │         
        │  a / c              Restart notice: list / dismiss                                                  │         
        │  PageUp / PageDown  Scroll focused pane                                                             │         
        │  F1                 Toggle this help                                                                │         
        │  [Close]                                                                                            │         
        │  Press ? or Esc to close                                                                            │         
        └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
